NAME
       who - show who is logged in

SYNOPSIS
       who [-b] [-r] [-m]
       who am i

DESCRIPTION
       who lists the login sessions: user name, terminal (tty1 for the
       console, pts/N for ssh and terminal windows), login time and, for
       remote logins, where from.

OPTIONS
       -b     Print the time of the last boot.

       -r     Print the current run level.

       -m, am i
              Only the session on this terminal.

EXAMPLES
           who
           who -b

SEE ALSO
       w(1), users(1), whoami(1), last(1)
